a single server. But if you want to monitor more than one server, you need
a single license on the monitoring server.
I actually got information from a DEC's sales representative, that the
license and the tool is no more on the market since August(IMHO). So you
can't monitor the servers from a single location (unless you run remote X
sessions), but it is not the same. You can still use the individual copy
of the product on your servers without licensing.

Mihaly





