Is ADVFS configured into the kernel?

        # cd /sys/conf
        # grep MSFS YOUR-HOSTNAME-IN-CAPS
        
If not, add the line:

        options         MSFS
        
near the top with all the other options, then

        # doconfig -c YOUR-HOSTNAME-IN-CAPS
        
When completed:

        # mv /vmunix /vmunix.old
        # mv /sys/YOUR-HOSTNAME-IN-CAPS/vmunix /
        # shutdown -r now
        
and try again.

        Stu



